      "data": {
        "value": "<p><strong>FLOW ID &ndash; 2409 FCM00278 AL0030</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Sample type &ndash; CSF in sterile vial</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Instrument &ndash;3 laser 10 colour BD FACS LYRIC</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Panel used &ndash; Customised </strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Method - Stain No Lyse No Wash</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Events acquired &ndash; 20,000</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Clinical details &ndash; Known case of B ALL (on maintenance) presented with cytopenias and headache. </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Gating Strategy: CD45 vs SSC</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Analysis &ndash; </strong>~61% of viable singlets gated in the blast window.</p>\n<p>These cells are positive for</p>\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid cke_show_border\" style=\"width: 54.5946%; height: 334.4px;\" cellspacing=\"0\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 39.3071%;\">\n<p>CD19</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.6262%;\">\n<p>Moderate - Bright</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 39.3071%;\">\n<p>CD10</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.6262%;\">\n<p>Bright</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 39.3071%;\">\n<p>CD34</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.6262%;\">\n<p>Moderate</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 39.3071%;\">\n<p>CD20</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.6262%;\">\n<p>Heterogenous</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 39.3071%;\">\n<p>cyCD79a</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.6262%;\">\n<p>Moderate</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 59px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 39.3071%;\">\n<p>HLA DR</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 60.6262%;\">\n<p>Bright</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>These cells are negative for myeloid markers (cyMPO, CD13, CD33, CD117) and T lineage markers (cyCD3, CD3, CD56, CD7).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Interpretation: Features suggest CNS disease in a known case of B ALL</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Advice: Please correlate with other investigations (Bone marrow status and MRD levels).</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "field": "textEditor"
      },
